  "title": "Tamil Nadu Launches New Property Registration Service",
  "summary": "The Tamil Nadu government has introduced a new property registration system called 'Presence-less Registration' to simplify the process of property registration without visiting the Sub-Registrar office, aiming to enhance transparency and efficiency.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Tamil Nadu launched the 'Presence-less Registration' system on August 17, 2026.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The system allows property registration by flat and plot promoters, bankers, and financial institutions without visiting the Sub-Registrar office.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The move aims to improve transparency and reduce administrative burden on property owners.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
